# LEGACY deprecation window — profiles moved OUT of the skill (v2).
#
# A workspace's profiles now live in the WORKSPACE tree at <home>/profiles/ — normally
# wiki-{project}/eng-rulebook/profiles/, else eng-rulebook-audit/profiles/ (see SKILL.md
# § Where eng-rulebook writes). Tracked there on purpose, so the facts travel to teammates.
# This skill carries none.
#
# This stanza stays for one deprecation window: a cloned install from before the relocation
# may still hold filled skill-local profiles, and without the ignore a reflexive
# `git add -A` + push would publish that workspace's session tiers, env tables, ids and
# thresholds to the shared library remote. Migrate (mv profiles/*.md
# <home>/profiles/), then this stanza can be dropped in a later release.
profiles/*
